    <description>Links a Boundary Application to a specific Salesforce object it reads from or writes to. Each record captures which single Salesforce object (for example Account, Opportunity, or a custom object) an external system touches, which CRUD operations it performs on that object, and how often it syncs. An admin should check this object for records matching a given object API name before deleting that object, changing its sharing model, or making other object-level changes.</description>
